# 256-Line Cap

All 21 files <= 256 lines. Largest is mcp_dispatch.oo and mcp_graph_dynamic.oo at 255.

# Generations G1-G13

G1 real-time: mcp_server_handle_body
G2 session:   McpSession with R5 replay gate
G3 surface:   tier-based method surface (minimal/full/audit)
G4 transport: stdio + file + unix-socket
G5 graph:     typed McpGraph (14 caps, 13 boards, 8 gates, substrate)
G6 version:   codexVersion + If-None-Match
G7 dynamic:   McpDynamicGraph with record/fold/persist/load
G8 gossip:    mcp_gossip_merge dedup
G9 cold-start: mcp_dynamic_load on boot
G10 redteam:   8 periodic probes fire on session close
G11 cert:     mcp_g11_self_certify exercises 14 caps against actual use
G12 federate: mcp_g12_federate_graphs merges local + peer by SHA-lex
G13 lineage:  mcp_g13_lineage_record appends versioned NDJSON entry per session

# Cap Chain (Zero-Ambient)

main(bind, fs, sys, env, time, fs_w, args)
  -> run_ooda_mcp(bind, fw, fs, env, sys, args)
    -> mcp_server_run(bind, fw, fs, env, t)
      -> mcp_transport_read(bind, fw, fs, t)
      -> mcp_dynamic_load(fs, path)                       # G9
      -> mcp_server_handle_body(fs, session, graph, codex, body)
        -> mcp_session_seen_id                            # R5
        -> mcp_dispatch_decide                            # phase + tier + URI
        -> mcp_dispatch_cap_audit                         # R7
        -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read (uses cache.graph_json)
        -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read_stream          # OODA streaming
      -> mcp_dynamic_fold + mcp_gossip_merge             # G7 + G8
      -> mcp_redteam_run_all                             # G10
      -> mcp_g11_self_certify                            # G11
      -> mcp_g12_local_export                            # G12
      -> mcp_g13_lineage_record                          # G13

# REDTEAM R1-R8

R1 subversion: PASS — caps minted by runtime; no string-forged caps.
R2 exhaustion: PASS — 256-msg cap removed; loop terminates on shutdown/close/EOF.
R3 obfuscation: PASS — lsp_jsonrpc_escape on every string field.
R4 injection:   PASS — mcp_orient_uri_is_canonical gates URIs to 6 values.
R5 replay:      PASS — mcp_session_seen_id returns -32603 on duplicate id.
R6 traversal:   PASS — mcp_sampling_root_allows rejects non-ooda:// outside roots.
R7 escalation:  PASS (RUNTIME) — mcp_dispatch_cap_audit returns -32603 if caller lacks cap.
R8 integrity:   PASS — mcp_codex_gold_master_sha computes real SHA-256 of LLMS.oot.

